  Sections:
  - Heading:
      m_Untranslated: Importing a CAD Model into Unity
    Text:
      m_Untranslated: <br>In this tutorial, you'll install Unity's Asset Transformer
        Toolkit (ATT), import a CAD model, adjust its import settings for accurate
        geometry and metadata, and add the resulting Prefab to your scene.
    Type: 0
